    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300511/2023005110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなにあるのか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ソファが全部ぬいぐるみで\r\n埋まってるじゃないか……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005110030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nかわいいでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300511/2023005110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "可愛い……けど、\r\nこれじゃあ誰も座れないだろ……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005110040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300511/2023005110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005110050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、今日はお客さんが来る予定が\r\n無いって確認したし～",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300511/2023005110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005110060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "前にプロデューサーに言われたとおり\r\nちゃんとまわりの状況を見て使ってるよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300511/2023005110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005110070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "終わったらちゃんと\r\n片付けもする！",
